# crypto-api 0.8.5 (vendored)

The hashers of [crypto-api](https://github.com/nf404/crypto-api) 0.8.5 (MIT, Copyright (c) 2015 nf404) used by
`legacy-hashes`: MD2, SHA-0, HAS-160 and Snefru, with their base classes. The files are unchanged except for the
`.mjs` extension added to the relative imports, which the package left out and which Vite's bundler requires.
